/F2 8 Tf (================================================================================) Tj /F1 8 Tf T*
/F2 8 Tf (DEFMAN-2026: THIRD NORMAL FORM \(3NF\) DATABASE MIGRATION & ARCHITECTURE DOCUMENT) Tj /F1 8 Tf T*
/F2 8 Tf (================================================================================) Tj /F1 8 Tf T*
(Project:      DefMan \(Defect Manager\) -- 2026 Edition) Tj T*
(Database:     MySQL 8.0+ / MariaDB 10.6+ \(InnoDB, utf8mb4_unicode_ci\)) Tj T*
(Backend:      PHP 8.3+ Strict-Typed PDO REST API) Tj T*
(Migration:    5 Legacy Denormalized Tables -> 10 Strict 3NF Relational Tables) Tj T*
(              + 3 Backward-Compatibility SQL Views \(`product`, `raport`, `analyse`\)) Tj T*
/F2 8 Tf (================================================================================) Tj /F1 8 Tf T*
() Tj T*
/F2 8 Tf (================================================================================) Tj /F1 8 Tf T*
/F2 8 Tf (SECTION 1. EXECUTIVE SUMMARY & NORMALIZATION ANALYSIS \(1NF, 2NF, 3NF\)) Tj /F1 8 Tf T*
/F2 8 Tf (================================================================================) Tj /F1 8 Tf T*
() Tj T*
(1.1 Overview of Legacy Schema Violations) Tj T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
(The legacy DefMan schema consisted of 5 tables \(`product`, `users`,) Tj T*
(`user_sessions`, `raport`, and `analyse`\) inherited from the 2004 schema design.) Tj T*
(While functional, it contained several First, Second, and Third Normal Form) Tj T*
(\(1NF, 2NF, 3NF\) anomalies as well as data-type and primary-key scalability) Tj T*
(bottlenecks:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  A. Naming & Primary Key Exhaustion Risks:) Tj T*
(     - Mixed-case and Polish/Finnish legacy identifiers \(`raport`, `analyse`,) Tj T*
(       `Product`, `CustomerID`, `Whenreported`, `Discoveredby`, `Occured`\).) Tj T*
(     - `raport.ID` and `analyse.id` used `SMALLINT UNSIGNED`, capping total) Tj T*
(       lifetime defect reports at 65,535 rows.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  B. First Normal Form \(1NF\) Violations:) Tj T*
(     - Repeating Groups / Multi-Valued Column: `analyse.phase` stored multiple) Tj T*
(       SDLC phases as a comma-delimited string \(e.g., 'Implementation,Testing'\),) Tj T*
(       preventing indexed phase queries and referential integrity.) Tj T*
(     - Non-Atomic String Timestamps & Redundant Dates: `raport.Whenreported`) Tj T*
(       stored timestamps as `VARCHAR\(32\)` \('YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm'\), while) Tj T*
(       `raport.Submitted` and `analyse.submitted` duplicated the date portion) Tj T*
(       across two tables.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  C. Second & Third Normal Form \(2NF / 3NF\) Violations:) Tj T*
(     - Unnormalized Organization Attribute in `users`: `users.company` repeated) Tj T*
(       free-text company names across user accounts.) Tj T*
(     - Transient Session & Recovery Attributes on `users`: `users.logged`) Tj T*
(       duplicated session state already tracked in `user_sessions`, causing) Tj T*
(       stale "Online" badges when sessions expired. Similarly,) Tj T*
(       `reset_token_hash` and `reset_token_expires_at` embedded 1:N recovery) Tj T*
(       lifecycle data directly inside the `users` entity.) Tj T*
(     - Denormalized Product Name in `raport`: `raport.Product` \(`VARCHAR\(100\)`\)) Tj T*
(       duplicated `product.name` alongside a nullable `product_id` FK.) Tj T*
(     - Transitive Reporter Identity in `raport`: `raport.Who` and) Tj T*
(       `raport.Contactemail` duplicated `users.login` and `users.email` even) Tj T*
(       when `CustomerID` referenced a valid registered user.) Tj T*
(     - Unnormalized Fault Taxonomy & Inconsistent Enums in `analyse`:) Tj T*
(       `analyse.classification` stored repeated IEEE 1044-1992 strings;) Tj T*
(       priority enums differed between `raport.Priority` \('m_urgent',) Tj T*
(       'average', 'l_urgent'\) and `analyse.priority` \('most urgent',) Tj T*
(       'average', 'less urgent'\); and `analyse.uniqueness` conflated defect) Tj T*
(       duplication \('New defect', 'Already submitted'\) with severity \('Critical'\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
(1.2 Target 3NF Relational Model \(10 Normalized Tables\)) Tj T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
(  1. `products`              : Standardized from `product` \(`id`, `name`, `created_at`\).) Tj T*
(  2. `companies`             : Extracted 3NF lookup table \(`id`, `name`, `created_at`\).) Tj T*
(  3. `users`                 : Normalized user accounts referencing `companies\(id\)`) Tj T*
(                               via `company_id`; `logged` and reset columns removed.) Tj T*
(  4. `user_sessions`         : Active bearer tokens; derives user online presence.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
