(1.4 Execution Order for Existing Databases vs. Fresh Deployments) Tj T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
(  * Existing Legacy Database Migration:) Tj T*
(      1. mysql -u root -p opr0413 < database/02_migrate_data.sql) Tj T*
(      2. mysql -u root -p opr0413 < database/03_legacy_views.sql) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  * Fresh Database Provisioning:) Tj T*
(      1. mysql -u root -p opr0413 < database/schema.sql) Tj T*
(      2. php backend/bin/seed.php) Tj T*
